 λ setup
 theme                       icons ● ◆ ○ ⎇ ▣ ±

  1/5  Look
  ┃ Theme
  ┃ > monokai the colors a workspace opens with
  ┃   lyna    dark with a green accent
  ┃   light   for light terminal backgrounds
  ┃   ansi    your terminal's own 16 colors

    Icons
      auto      unicode on UTF-8 locales, ascii otherwise
      unicode   one-cell symbols that draw in common fonts
      nerd      glyphs from a patched icon font
      ascii     plain characters only

    Status bar
      auto        pointed separators with a patched icon font
      powerline   pointed separators, whatever the icons
      plain       no separators

    Color depth
      auto        detected from COLORTERM and TERM
      truecolor   24-bit color
      256         the xterm 256-color palette
      16          the basic terminal palette



 enter next  shift+tab back  ctrl+c cancel
